ry disease risk in South Asians?</article-title><source>Int J Cardiol</source><year>2008</year><volume>129</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>132</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18255168</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijcard.2007.12.019</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>